From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Fri, 07 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Disable Cuttlefish-only aosp_shared_system_image module

Soong runs verifyGenericConfig() on all android_system_image modules
regardless of the active build target. The aosp_shared_system_image
module is only used by Cuttlefish, but its validation fails when
TrebleDroid patches add vendor-specific HAL dependencies (e.g.
Samsung HIDL/AIDL interfaces) to framework modules. Disable it to
prevent false build failures.
---
 target/product/generic/Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/target/product/generic/Android.bp b/target/product/generic/Android.bp
--- a/target/product/generic/Android.bp
+++ b/target/product/generic/Android.bp
@@ -1092,6 +1092,7 @@
 android_system_image {
     name: "aosp_shared_system_image",
     defaults: ["system_image_defaults"],
+    enabled: false,
     dirs: android_rootdirs,
     symlinks: android_symlinks,
     type: "erofs",
-- 
